# CyberLens

CyberLens is an AI-powered smart glasses project designed for real-time navigation and danger detection.

## Main Features

### Navigation
- Real-time route guidance
- Voice navigation
- Hands-free experience

### Danger Detection
- Vehicle detection
- Obstacle detection
- Safety alerts

### Microsoft Technologies

- Azure Maps
- Azure AI Vision
- Azure AI Speech

## First Milestone

Build real-world navigation using Azure Maps.
